# Agent worktrees and scratch. These hold full copies of src/, so without
# this every tool that walks the tree (eslint, tsc, search) sees each file
# twice - lint reported exactly double until this was added.
.claude/

# Subagent-driven-development scratch: per-plan ledgers, task briefs, reports
# and review diffs. Working notes for a run in progress, not project history -
# git log is the record once a plan is done.
.superpowers/

